error[E0498]: an any cannot be the result of a spawned call
 --> $DIR/any-spawn-result.nra:7:26
  |
7 |         let task = spawn work();
  |                          ^^^^^^ this has type any
  |
  = note: the boundary would box the value; an any is four inline words
  = help: match the value first and pass what it holds

For more information about this error, try `neura explain E0498`.
